### Tooltip Display
Custom tooltip renderer using Fabric's tooltip rendering hook. Anchored at the top of the item tooltip:
- A pixel-rendered XP bar (styled like the vanilla durability bar, inside the tooltip)
- `(240/500) XP` text beneath it
- Current item level
- Standard slots listed (filled or empty), normal white text
- Bonus slots listed beneath, each prefixed with ★(a star) in gold text
- `[BROKEN]` state reflected in name and tooltip only when actively broken.
- "MAX LEVEL" replaces the level line when `maxed` is true

